# Backend standards (MyWallet)

Apply to PHP under `app/`, `src/Wallets/`, `routes/`, `tests/`.

## TDD first

1. Write a failing unit or feature test.
2. Implement the minimum code to pass.
3. Refactor while tests stay green.

New command, query, endpoint, or domain rule ships with a test in the same change.

## Architecture (inward only)

```
app/Http (Presentation) → src/Wallets/*/Application → Domain
src/Wallets/*/Infrastructure → Domain ports
```

Bounded contexts live under `src/Wallets/<Context>/`:

| Layer | Path | Rules |
|-------|------|-------|
| Domain | `.../Domain/` | Entities, VOs, pure calc — no Eloquent, HTTP, Laravel facades |
| Application | `.../Application/{Command,Query,Handler}/` | Orchestration; depend on ports / shared abstractions |
| Infrastructure | `.../Shared/Infrastructure/` (+ context infra as needed) | Eloquent, clock, config, logger adapters |
| Presentation | `app/Http/Controllers/` | Thin — dispatch `CommandBus` / `QueryBus` only |

Wire handlers in `app/Providers/WalletsServiceProvider.php` (composition root).

One type per use case: `Command|Query` + matching `*Handler`.

## CQRS

- **Command** = mutate; data-only DTO.
- **Query** = read; must not mutate domain state.
- Controllers call `$this->commands->dispatch(...)` / `$this->queries->ask(...)`, not handlers directly.

```text
✅ CreateLoan + CreateLoanHandler registered on CommandBus
❌ Controller new-ing AmortizationService and writing Eloquent inline
```

## No magic values

Named constants / enums / config keys for statuses, wallet types, TX types, allowlists (`config/wallets.php`).

## Testing (PHPUnit)

| Layer | Suite | Location |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Domain / pure application | Unit | `tests/Unit/<Context>/` |
| HTTP, Socialite, DB flows | Feature | `tests/Feature/<Context>/` |

Mirror context names under `tests/` — do not colocate tests next to `src/`.

## Forbidden

- Business rules in controllers
- Domain importing Eloquent / facades / HTTP
- Query handlers mutating state
- Skipping tests for “simple” changes
